  "prefLabel": "Site 102.18 Cumulative impacts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.18 “Cumulative impacts” means the totality of effects resulting from a proposed wind energy facility, all existing wind energy facilities, all wind energy facilities for which a certificate of site and facility has been granted, and all proposed wind energy facilities for which an application has been accepted.\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
